<title>UK: CRICKET-RESULTS OF FRIENDLY MATCHES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RESULTS OF FRIENDLY MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of three-day friendly matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>At Fenners: Derbyshire beat Cambridge University by an innings and 12 runs. Cambridge University 195 and 156 (R.Jones 57 not out; K.Dean 4-39), Derbyshire 363-7 declared (A.Rollins 79, D.Jones 58, V.Clark 57).  </p>
<p>At Oxford (The Parks): Durham beat Oxford University by 97 runs. Durham 353-2 declared and 144-3 declared (D.Boon 58), Oxford University 153 and 247 (C.Patel 50, S.Brown 4-35).</p>
</text>
